_platon_squeeze_details
;
Ethyl acetate was used for crystallization. 
Solvent atoms were found in the structure
which could not be identified clearly due
to partial occupancy and disorder. The solvent
was SQUEEZED out using PLATON. The number of
electrons, 43 in the unit cell, and 10.7 electrons
per asymmetric unit accounts for a water molecule 
disordered in several positions.
;
